22:1 COMMENT "# factory returning an escape-capable owned protocol. Bound to a new"
22:69 EOL "\n"
23:1 COMMENT "# name, a projection borrows its source, so `.take` hands `f` over and"
23:71 EOL "\n"
24:1 COMMENT "# invalidates it; one handed straight to an owner -- `return Reader f` --"
24:74 EOL "\n"
25:1 COMMENT "# takes its source unmarked."
25:29 EOL "\n"
